{"org":"netty","repo":"netty","prNumber":"14076","commit":"55b0e70f00aaf4d4841b56049f6fbe1e57f0e323","generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The `ReadOnlySlicedByteBuf` and `ReadOnlyDuplicatedByteBuf` classes override methods like `slice`, `duplicate`, `isWritable`, and `isWritable(int numBytes)`. While these changes ensure that the returned buffers are also read-only, it is important to verify that all possible mutation methods are overridden to maintain immutability. Additionally, the `asReadOnly()` method in both classes returns `this`, which is correct but should be consistent with the behavior of other buffer implementations.","nodes":[{"id":"buffer/src/test/java/io/netty/buffer/AbstractByteBufTest.java-buffer/src/test/java/io/netty/buffer/AbstractByteBufTest.java--184450:184663","promptId":"#N4P8Z","srcPath":"buffer/src/test/java/io/netty/buffer/AbstractByteBufTest.java","dstPath":"buffer/src/test/java/io/netty/buffer/AbstractByteBufTest.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":184450,"endPos":184663,"startLine":5556,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":5562,"endLineOffset":5,"length":214}]},{"id":"buffer/src/main/java/io/netty/buffer/ReadOnlyByteBuf.java-buffer/src/main/java/io/netty/buffer/ReadOnlyByteBuf.java-7430:7488-7430:7480","promptId":"#ZDPAT","srcPath":"buffer/src/main/java/io/netty/buffer/ReadOnlyByteBuf.java","dstPath":"buffer/src/main/java/io/netty/buffer/ReadOnlyByteBuf.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":7430,"endPos":7488,"startLine":298,"startLineOffset":15,"endLine":298,"endLineOffset":73,"length":59}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":7430,"endPos":7480,"startLine":298,"startLineOffset":15,"endLine":298,"endLineOffset":65,"length":51}]},{"id":"buffer/src/test/java/io/netty/buffer/ReadOnlyDirectByteBufferBufTest.java-buffer/src/test/java/io/netty/buffer/ReadOnlyDirectByteBufferBufTest.java--18597:18782,18788:18973,18979:19156,19162:19368,19374:19576,19582:19780,19786:19976,19982:20177","promptId":"#AN1BX","srcPath":"buffer/src/test/java/io/netty/buffer/ReadOnlyDirectByte